    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91528" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυξ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>box
				of box-wood</i>: generally, <i>box</i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				249.1
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				125.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4324.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Philops.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χαλκῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Trypho
					<u>Trop.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἰατρικαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					77.28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.11
			</span></i>; for poison, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.30.7
			</span></i>; so Lat. <i>pyxis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				25.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Juv.
				13.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cylinder</i> in which a piston works, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυξίον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				632.57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> name of a
				<i>plaster</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				12.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				3.78
			</span></i>.</div>
